r understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":768362,\"title\":\"Missing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wEOUYSU5Uf8J7152PT6jdb5233Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tVH1qEFyKiCpP6kNDFyXKW2Tiif.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her mother disappears while on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend, June’s search for answers is hindered by international red tape. Stuck thousands of miles away in Los Angeles, June creatively uses all the latest technology at her fingertips to try and find her before it’s too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":174772,\"title\":\"Europa Report\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tbsfaBjiAW5vfrV06R8KCOzVOYy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9qngWwy9ijFgpz8JqdadOSgKcWR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A crew travels to Europa, Jupiter’s icy moon, to investigate signs of life in its subsurface ocean, but disaster cuts them off from Earth, leading to a tense and dangerous exploration.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":63197,\"title\":\"Megan Is Missing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lDmIqn0HJDjQJZDZaofuyaAnw2X.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hGTK2dnm1vXYpr26QGWjXIVpI9l.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fourteen-year–old Megan and her best friend Amy spend a lot of time on the internet, posting videos of themselves and chatting with guys online. One night Megan chats with a guy named Josh who convinces her to meet him for a date. The next day, Megan is missing—forever. Based on actual cases of child abduction.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43933,\"title\":\"Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cARETxTELl8kQCIcpbRhEcMjkPD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/imiBIsvNU3TbMB3sbqKanKODS33.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Six years ago NASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched to collect samples, but crashed upon re-entry over Central America. Soon after, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as an infected zone. Today, the American and Mexican military still struggle to contain \\\"the creatures,\\\" while a journalist agrees to escort a shaken tourist through the infected zone in Mexico to the safety of the U.S. border.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":320048,\"title\":\"Ratter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vSwYyxa12OqcrVnW6qPGqIBFyh2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmwyGjvG2SPox7jVudJXWu1YrQS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn't realize is that she's sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn't enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25218,\"title\":\"Live!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91FAYeluKya14DmtENl8yzzWBv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8esZgBRtP5lY0g0Ui8kLn6rceW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mockumentary following an ambitious TV network executive trying to produce a controversial reality show where contestants play Russian Roulette.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376453,\"title\":\"Operation Avalanche\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ngw7s1fa0eJL19fJ6Jw0bTQg3n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsrzZigEWtohP7vUVVgX8sVKiDV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1967, four undercover CIA agents were sent to NASA posing as a documentary film crew. What they discovered led to one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":242606,\"title\":\"Keep Watching\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wHsHaYUbLJNSt8T8QcFgZqy7Om.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u0SmCStAg5GS8Pis36RsoailrRG.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A family imprisoned by intruders is forced to play a terrifying game of \\\"Kill, Or Be Killed\\\". As the night unfolds, the game's mysterious rules become clear, and the family realizes their nightmare is being streamed live to riveted viewers all over the world, who are compelled to KEEP WATCHING... not knowing if what they're seeing is real, or staged.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":493675,\"title\":\"Profile\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znkwk7R4wb0JpT0Lc3a0sAPnnD0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/utrwOVJFglRIJFsOhQUZ9fDyaXH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Looking to investigate recruitment techniques of ISIS to lure women into Syria, a journalist creates a Facebook profile of a Muslim convert. When an ISIS recruiter contacts her online character, she experiences the process first hand.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"hfS7Q0YxvjE\",\"name\":\"Offici